{
  "info": {
    "name": "MasterConfig API - Bearer Token Auth",
    "description": "Complete API collection for MasterConfig service with Bearer token authentication compatible with handleTokenAuth.verifyGameToken.\n\n## Authentication Strategy\n- **Type**: Bearer Token (RFC 6750)\n- **Token Format**: {base64url_payload}.{hex_signature}\n- **Header**: Authorization: Bearer {token}\n- **Required Fields**: uid, rid, app_id, server_id, ts\n- **Signature**: HMAC-SHA256 hex-encoded\n\n## Setup Instructions\n1. Import the environment file: `MasterConfig_Dev.postman_environment.json`\n2. Set your environment variables (app_id, secret, uid, etc.)\n3. The pre-request script will automatically generate and attach Bearer tokens to requests\n\n## Token Expiration\n- Dev: 300 seconds (5 minutes)\n- Clock skew tolerance: 30 seconds\n- Future time allowance: 10 seconds",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "masterconfig-team"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Global Pre-request Script for Bearer Token Authentication",
          "// Compatible with handleTokenAuth.verifyGameToken in auth.go",
          "// Token Format: {base64url_payload}.{hex_signature}",
          "",
          "function base64UrlEncode(wordArray) {",
          "    // Convert WordArray to Base64",
          "    let base64 = CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(wordArray);",
          "    // Convert Base64 to Base64URL (RFC 4648)",
          "    return base64",
          "        .replace(/\\+/g, '-')",
          "        .replace(/\\//g, '_')",
          "        .replace(/=/g, '');",
          "}",
          "",
          "function generateBearerToken() {",
          "    // Get environment variables",
          "    const appId = pm.environment.get('app_id');",
          "    const secret = pm.environment.get('secret');",
          "    const uid = pm.environment.get('uid') || 'test_user_001';",
          "    const rid = pm.environment.get('rid') || `req_${Date.now()}`;",
          "    const serverId = pm.environment.get('server_id') || 'server_01';",
          "    ",
          "    if (!appId || !secret) {",
          "        console.error('Missing required environment variables: app_id or secret');",
          "        return null;",
          "    }",
          "    ",
          "    // Create timestamp (current Unix time in seconds)",
          "    const ts = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
          "    ",
          "    // Build token payload (must match GameTokenPayload struct)",
          "    const payload = {",
          "        uid: uid,",
          "        rid: rid,",
          "        app_id: appId,",
          "        server_id: serverId,",
          "        ts: ts",
          "    };",
          "    ",
          "    // Convert payload to JSON string (compact, no whitespace)",
          "    const payloadJson = JSON.stringify(payload);",
          "    ",
          "    // Base64URL encode the payload (RFC 4648)",
          "    const payloadWordArray = CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(payloadJson);",
          "    const payloadBase64Url = base64UrlEncode(payloadWordArray);",
          "    ",
          "    // Compute HMAC-SHA256 signature on the JSON payload",
          "    const signatureHex = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(payloadJson, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
          "    ",
          "    // Combine into final token format: {base64url_payload}.{hex_signature}",
          "    const token = `${payloadBase64Url}.${signatureHex}`;",
          "    ",
          "    console.log('=== Bearer Token Generated ===');",
          "    console.log('Payload:', payload);",
          "    console.log('Payload JSON:', payloadJson);",
          "    console.log('Base64URL Payload:', payloadBase64Url);",
          "    console.log('HMAC-SHA256 Signature:', signatureHex);",
          "    console.log('Final Token:', token);",
          "    console.log('Timestamp:', ts, '(' + new Date(ts * 1000).toISOString() + ')');",
          "    console.log('==============================');",
          "    ",
          "    return token;",
          "}",
          "",
          "// Generate and set Bearer token",
          "const token = generateBearerToken();",
          "if (token) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('bearer_token', token);",
          "    console.log('Bearer token set successfully in environment variable: bearer_token');",
          "} else {",
          "    console.error('Failed to generate Bearer token');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Characters",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Character by ID",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has correct structure', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('success', true);",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('data');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('error', null);",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('meta');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Character data is valid', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const character = jsonData.data;",
                  "    ",
                  "    pm.expect(character).to.have.property('character_id');",
                  "    pm.expect(character).to.have.property('meta');",
                  "    pm.expect(character).to.have.property('baseStats');",
                  "    pm.expect(character.meta).to.have.property('rarity');",
                  "    pm.expect(character.meta).to.have.property('element');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response time is acceptable', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{bearer_token}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "Bearer token for authentication (auto-generated)"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{api_key}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "API key for caller identification"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-API-Version",
                "value": "v1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/masterconfig/characters/:character_id",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "masterconfig", "characters", ":character_id"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "character_id",
                  "value": "char_001",
                  "description": "Unique character identifier"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves a specific character by their unique character ID.\n\n**Authentication**: Token-based (automatically generated)\n\n**Path Parameters**:\n- `character_id` (string, required): The unique identifier for the character\n\n**Response**: Returns character details including meta, base stats, growths, assets, and skill set."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Characters",
          "event": [
