            "description": "Retrieves a paginated list of characters with optional filtering.\n\n**Authentication**: Token-based (automatically generated)\n\n**Query Parameters**:\n- `page`: Page number (default: 1)\n- `page_size`: Items per page (default: 20, max: 100)\n- `rarity`: Filter by rarity (R, SR, SSR)\n- `element`: Filter by element\n- `gender`: Filter by gender\n- `sort_by`: Field to sort by\n- `sort_order`: Sort order (asc/desc)"
          },
          "response": []
